        <body>
            <div xml:id="d642">

                <pb facs="1168" n="1044" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg1044"/>

                <head>No. 638.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Evarts to Mr. Fairchild.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-12-02"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 2,
                        1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fairchild</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Minister, Madrid:</hi></p>
                <p>I am much chagrined that our complaints in regard to the interference by Spanish
                    cruisers with American vessels have produced no result.</p>
                <p>Ascertain, and telegraph when aswer may be expected.</p>
                <closer><signed>EVARTS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
